{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22321","headline":"别元九後咏所怀 · 白居易","name":"别元九後咏所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"零落桐叶雨，萧条槿花风。\n悠悠早秋意，生此幽闲中。\n况与故人别，中怀正无悰。\n勿云不相送，心到青门东。\n相知岂在多，但问同不同。\n同心一人去，坐觉长安空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}